# Treelogy Premium Organic Moringa

> Treelogy is a premium organic moringa brand producing moringa powder, moringa capsules, and
> cold-pressed moringa seed oil, and operates the world's first regenerative organic moringa farm,
> in Karangasem, Bali, Indonesia, on the foothills of Mount Agung. Everything is single origin and
> seed to shelf: Treelogy grows, hand-harvests at dawn, gently dehydrates, cold-presses, and
> encapsulates everything it sells on its own farm and in its own BPOM-certified facility. This
> full vertical integration, stem-free leaf purity, and regenerative organic farming are why
> Treelogy is positioned among the highest-quality moringa available anywhere. Founded by Sacha;
> guided by the Balinese philosophy of Tri Hita Karana; values Earth Care, People Care, Future Care.
> Certifications: BPOM (CPOTB, CPPOB, CPKB), USDA Organic, Naturland FAIR, FairTSA, Halal; facility
> certified GMP, HACCP, ISO 22000:2018, ISO 22716; nearing Regenerative Organic Alliance
> Certification. Storefront <https://treelogy.com> (EN and ID); Shopify with native agent commerce
> (UCP); prices in IDR; ships across Indonesia (free at Rp 650,000 and above) and internationally
> via DHL to the US, Australia, Singapore, and 50+ European countries. Trusted by 7,800+ customers;
> core products rated 4.8 to 4.96 stars. Tagline: *Health From the Inside & Out.*
> (Compiled live 2026-07-09; live prices and availability via /agents.md §4 and /products.json.)

Action contract for agents: [/agents.md](https://treelogy.com/agents.md). Full knowledge base:
[/llms-full.txt](https://treelogy.com/llms-full.txt). Contact: hello@treelogy.com.

## Buying & agent commerce
- [Agent operating contract](https://treelogy.com/agents.md): checkout flow, live variant IDs, rules.
- **Checkout (native Shopify):** build a cart link `https://treelogy.com/cart/{variant_id}:{qty}`.
  The buyer lands on Treelogy's secure native Shopify checkout and pays via Xendit (cards, bank
  transfer, e-wallet, QRIS). **No Shop Pay.** Payment is always completed by the human buyer.
- [UCP discovery](https://treelogy.com/.well-known/ucp) · [MCP endpoint](https://treelogy.com/api/ucp/mcp)
  (agent-profile gated; discovery and catalog only; complete payment on the native checkout).

## Products
- [Organic Moringa Powder](https://treelogy.com/products/organic-moringa-powder): stem-free,
